                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/23562: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Consul at Guaymas</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Yost</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-13T18:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">April 13,
                                1920—6 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>Your April 10, 6 p.m.</p>
                <p>I have suggested to Navy Department that war vessel be sent to Guaymas.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
